{#
Links for functions to configure NLP services.
#}

{% set keys = path('nlpservices.api_configuration_form') %}
{% set keysVerification = path('nlpservices.key_validate_form') %}
{% set activistCode = path('nlpservices.activist_code_configuration_form') %}
{% set responseCodes = path('nlpservices.response_code_configuration_form') %}
{% set surveyQuestion = path('nlpservices.survey_question_configuration_form') %}
{% set emails = path('nlpservices.email_configuration_form') %}
{% set electionCycle = path('nlpservices.election_configuration_form') %}
{% set importReports = path('nlpservices.import_reports_form') %}
{% set importAwards = path('nlpservices.import_table_form', {'tableName': 'nlp_awards'}) %}
{% set importTurfAssignments = path('nlpservices.import_table_form', {'tableName': 'nlp_turf_assignment'}) %}
{% set importUsers = path('nlpservices.import_user_accounts_form') %}
{% set exportUsers = path('nlpservices.export_user_accounts_file') %}
{% set exportReports = path('nlpservices.export_voter_contact_reports_form') %}
{% set votebuilderUpdate = path('nlpservices.votebuilder_update_date_form') %}
{% set exportAwardsFile = path('nlpservices.export_table', {'tableName': 'nlp_awards','source': 'config'}) %}
{% set exportTurfAssignments = path('nlpservices.export_table', {'tableName': 'nlp_turf_assignment','source': 'config'}) %}
{% set exportCredentials = path('nlpservices.export_credentials_file') %}
{% set purgeNlUsers = path('nlpservices.purge_nl_accounts') %}
{% set importCredentials = path('nlpservices.import_credentials_form') %}
{% set enableDebug = path('nlpservices.enable_debug_form') %}
{% set databaseSchema = path('nlpservices.database_schema_form') %}
{% set enableCronTasks = path('nlpservices.enable_cron_tasks_form') %}
{% set documents = path('nlpservices.document_configuration_form') %}
{% set welcome = path('nlpservices.welcome') %}

<div class="nlp-menu-page">
{% trans %}

    <h1>New site or new election</h1>
    <p>The following 9 steps are to create a new NLP Services site and set up a new election.   For just a new
        election, steps 3, 4 and 5 can be repeated with new information.</p>

    <ul>
        <li><a href={{ keys }}>Step 1: Build the database for API keys.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ keysVerification }}>Step 2: Verify the API keys work.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ electionCycle }}>Step 3: Set up the election date and name.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ activistCode }}>Step 4: Set up the activist codes.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ responseCodes }}>Step 5: Set up the canvass response codes.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ surveyQuestion }}>Step 6: Select the survey question.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ emails }}>Step 7: Set up the email used by the site.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ documents }}>Step 8: Set up the training documents.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ welcome }}>Step 9: Build the Welcome page.</a></li>

    </ul>

    <h1>Rebuild a site</h1>
    <p>The next steps are needed if you are rebuilding a site for an existing NLP.</p>

    <ul>
        <li><a href={{ importReports }}>Step 10: Import historical voter contact reports.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ importAwards }}>Step 11: Import NL Awards file.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ importUsers }}>Step 12: Import Drupal user accounts.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ importTurfAssignments }}>Step 13: Import the turf assignments file.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ importCredentials }}>Step 14: Import NL credentials.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ documents }}>Step 15: Replace one of the default documents.</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h1>Enable Cron tasks</h1>
    <ul>
        <li><a href={{ enableCronTasks }}>Enable the various cron tasks for NLP.</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h1>VoterFile update.</h1>
    <ul>
        <li><a href={{ votebuilderUpdate }}>Set date of the latest VoterFile update.</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h1>Archive election</h1>
    <p>The remaining steps are to retain the results of an election either to prepare to rebuild the
        site or to archive results.</p>

    <ul>
        <li><a href={{ exportUsers }}>Export Drupal user accounts.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ exportCredentials }}>Export Drupal user login credentials.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ exportReports }}>Export the voter contact reports table.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ exportAwardsFile }}>Export the NL awards table.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ exportTurfAssignments }}>Export the turf assignments table.</a></li>
        <br>
        <li><a href={{ purgeNlUsers }}>Purge NL user accounts.</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h1>Testing</h1>
    <ul>
        <li><a href={{ enableDebug }}>Enable debug displays.</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ databaseSchema }}>Verify the database tables</a></li>
    </ul>

{% endtrans %}
</div>
